{
  "schema": "remotive-dashboard:0.2",
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "iframe",
      "grid": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 7,
        "h": 7
      },
      "content": {
        "url": "http://localhost:6080"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "restbus",
      "grid": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 6
      },
      "content": {
        "frames": [
          {
            "channel": "ChassisCan0",
            "frame": "UISpeedFrame"
          },
          {
            "channel": "BodyCan0",
            "frame": "TurnLightControl"
          },
          {
            "channel": "BodyCan0",
            "frame": "GearInfo"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "signal-value-timeseries",
      "settings": {
        "useSuggestedMinMax": false,
        "yAxisSettings": {
          "showDecimal": false,
          "showHex": false,
          "showNamed": true
        },
        "syncChart": true,
        "chartWidthSeconds": 30,
        "maxFps": 60
      },
      "grid": {
        "x": 7,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 5,
        "h": 7
      },
      "content": {
        "signals": [
          {
            "namespace": "topology-BodyCan0",
            "frame": "TurnLightControl",
            "signal": "TurnLightControl.LeftTurnLightRequest"
          },
          {
            "namespace": "topology-BodyCan0",
            "frame": "DIMStatus",
            "signal": "DIMStatus.LeftIndicatorLamp"
          },
          {
            "namespace": "topology-BodyCan0",
            "frame": "TurnLightControl",
            "signal": "TurnLightControl.RightTurnLightRequest"
          },
          {
            "namespace": "topology-BodyCan0",
            "frame": "DIMStatus",
            "signal": "DIMStatus.RightIndicatorLamp"
          },
          {
            "namespace": "topology-ChassisCan0",
            "frame": "UISpeedFrame",
            "signal": "UISpeedFrame.uispeed"
          },
          {
            "namespace": "topology-BodyCan0",
            "frame": "DIMStatus",
            "signal": "DIMStatus.DisplayedSpeed"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "trace",
      "settings": {
        "groupByFrame": true,
        "expandSignals": true,
        "bufferSize": 10000,
        "sortOrder": "newest-first"
      },
      "grid": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 2
      },
      "content": {
        "frames": [
          {
            "namespace": "topology-BodyCan0",
            "frame": "DIMStatus",
            "signals": []
          },
          {
            "namespace": "topology-BodyCan0",
            "frame": "GearInfo",
            "signals": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "grid": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 3
      },
      "content": {
        "text": "# Instrument cluster\n\nThe restbus panel sets the frames the cluster consumes, on the mocks that send them. The chart shows them next to what the cluster reports back in `DIMStatus` on BodyCan0.\n\n**Speed**: `UISpeedFrame.uispeed` on ChassisCan0, in m/s. 20 shows as **72 km/h** and comes back as `DIMStatus.DisplayedSpeed`.\n\n**Turn lights**: `TurnLightControl.LeftTurnLightRequest` / `RightTurnLightRequest` on BodyCan0, 1 lights the lamp. The cluster reports it in `DIMStatus.LeftIndicatorLamp` / `RightIndicatorLamp`. A BCM blinks the request, here it stays as set.\n\n**Gear**: `GearInfo.GearLeverPosition` on BodyCan0, 0 Reverse, 1 Drive, traced below with `DIMStatus`. `DisplayedGear` 1 = Reverse, 2 = Drive."
      }
    }
  ],
  "name": "cluster"
}
